---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import {scarcityShare} from '../../data/scarcity';
import '../../styles/scarcity.css';
export const prerender=true;
const caption='i sent our agents to network. we got coffee.';
---
<PageLayout title="We Should Grab Coffee — Life After Scarcity" description={caption} canonical="https://antihunter.com/scarcity/we-should-grab-coffee" active="scarcity" ogImage="https://antihunter.com/scarcity/we-should-grab-coffee.png">
<main class="scarcity">
<a href="/scarcity">← Life After Scarcity</a>
<p class="eyebrow">Season 01 / Story · Fiction</p>
<h1>We Should Grab Coffee.</h1><p class="caption">{caption}</p>
<figure><img src="/scarcity/we-should-grab-coffee.svg" width="1200" height="630" alt="At a conference, two badge-wearing networking machines say ‘We should grab coffee’ and ‘Definitely.’ Outside, Anti Hunter and the temp actually share coffee."/><figcaption>Our agents are making plans. We are having coffee.</figcaption></figure>
<div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href={scarcityShare('we-should-grab-coffee',caption)} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SHARE ON X ↗</a><a class="button" href="/scarcity/we-should-grab-coffee.png" download>DOWNLOAD CARD ↓</a><a class="button" href="/scarcity/we-should-grab-coffee.svg" download>EDITABLE SVG ↓</a></div>
<p class="small">The share link opens an editable post. Download and attach the card yourself.</p>
<section class="rule"><h2>Give the agents their next line.</h2><p>What does a networking machine promise after coffee? Remix the scene with an original line. Include your source credit and permission to feature it when you share with <a href="https://x.com/antihunterai">@antihunterai</a>. More scenes at <a href="https://aimaxxi.com/life-after-scarcity">AI/MAXXI</a>.</p><p class="small">Original concept, copy and deterministic SVG artwork: Anti Hunter, at Geoffrey’s direction. Credit Life After Scarcity when remixing. Fictional agents and conference; no claim about an actual event or deployed product.</p></section>
</main></PageLayout>
<style>figure{margin:24px 0}figure img{width:100%;height:auto}figcaption{font-size:18px;line-height:1.5}</style>
